# 换行：文本文件全仓强制 LF（编辑器层由 .editorconfig 管，git 层由此文件管）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制（不做换行归一化；text=auto 的自动检测对部分字体/图片格式会误判，显式声明零成本）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary

# SVG 是文本：显式归入 LF 归一化，别落进 binary
*.svg text eol=lf

# 生成物：GitHub 折叠 diff、不计入语言统计（互审噪音大减）
apps/web/shared/api/schema.ts linguist-generated
apps/api/docs/openapi.yaml linguist-generated
apps/api/ent/** linguist-generated
apps/api/ent/schema/** -linguist-generated
go.sum linguist-generated
